@startuml state_connection
title Firmware connected flag (not the hardware watchdog)
[*] --> Disconnected : setup
state Disconnected : Connected=false\nno controls or debug traffic\nwaiting/lost matrix state
state Connected : Connected=true\ncontrols sampled every 25 ms\nsend on change or 200 ms keepalive
Disconnected --> Connected : valid known packet
Connected --> Connected : valid packet / refresh receive time
Connected --> Disconnected : >2000 ms without valid packet
Disconnected --> [*] : after a previous connection, >30 s silence\nNVIC_SystemReset
note right of Disconnected : If the foreground loop itself stalls,\nthe hardware watchdog resets the board after ~2 s.
@enduml
